# PHPUnit

- This application uses PHPUnit for testing. All PHPUnit tests must extend the project's base test case classes.
- Generate tests with `{{ assist.cakeCommand('bake test {Name}') }}` when appropriate, or add classes beside sibling tests.
- If you see a test using Pest syntax in a PHPUnit-only area, follow the dominant convention in that directory.
- Every time a test has been updated, run that singular test before moving on.
- Tests should cover happy paths, failure paths, and edge cases.

## Running Tests
- Run the minimal number of tests with an appropriate filter before finalizing.
- Run all tests: `{{ assist.cakeCommand('test') }}`.
- Run one file: `{{ assist.cakeCommand('test tests/TestCase/ExampleTest.php') }}`.
- Filter by name: `{{ assist.cakeCommand('test --filter testName') }}` (recommended after editing a related file).
